WEBVTT

00:00:04.936 --> 00:00:06.771
(sniffing)

00:00:07.397 --> 00:00:08.273
(gasps)

00:00:09.607 --> 00:00:12.026
(grunting)

00:00:15.738 --> 00:00:16.990
(panting)

00:00:17.073 --> 00:00:18.575
(yells)

00:00:18.658 --> 00:00:20.243
-(wind whistles)
-(groans)

00:00:20.326 --> 00:00:21.661
(yells)

00:00:21.744 --> 00:00:23.538
(whimpers)

00:00:23.621 --> 00:00:25.957
(laughing)

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:27.876
(groans)

00:00:29.961 --> 00:00:31.880
(rumbling)

00:00:35.383 --> 00:00:38.094
(rumbling)

00:00:38.636 --> 00:00:39.470
(Crash and Eddie laugh)

00:00:39.554 --> 00:00:42.223
Wait for it,
Wait for it!

00:00:43.349 --> 00:00:44.642
(whooping, cheering)

00:00:44.726 --> 00:00:48.271
(laughing, hooting)

00:00:49.397 --> 00:00:50.315
(gasps)

00:00:50.398 --> 00:00:51.816
(sighs)

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:52.817
(both laugh)

00:00:52.901 --> 00:00:53.818
That was awesome!

00:00:53.902 --> 00:00:54.861
Can I ask
you guys something?

00:00:54.944 --> 00:00:57.322
How are you both so happy?

00:00:57.405 --> 00:00:59.532
Doesn't it weigh on you
that the world might be ending?

00:00:59.616 --> 00:01:02.035
Can I tell him our secret?

00:01:02.118 --> 00:01:04.329
Come here.
Come here.

00:01:04.412 --> 00:01:08.499
We're very, very... stupid.

00:01:12.212 --> 00:01:15.673
But still, you're not
a teensy bit concerned about,

00:01:15.757 --> 00:01:18.134
oh, I don't know,
say, imminent death?

00:01:19.969 --> 00:01:21.429
Beep.

00:01:21.512 --> 00:01:22.347
(sighs)

00:01:22.430 --> 00:01:23.848
I'm gonna go find Peaches.

00:01:27.685 --> 00:01:28.853
ETHAN: Hey, guys, over here.

00:01:28.937 --> 00:01:30.647
Come on. It's a shortcut.

00:01:31.314 --> 00:01:32.398
You're gonna love this.

00:01:32.482 --> 00:01:33.316
KATIE: Come on, girls.

00:01:33.816 --> 00:01:35.193
Let's have some fun.

00:01:35.276 --> 00:01:36.194
Wow.

00:01:36.277 --> 00:01:37.904
This is so cool.

00:01:37.987 --> 00:01:39.364
STEFFIE: It's like we're
upside down.

00:01:39.447 --> 00:01:41.282
MEGHAN: That is amazing.

00:01:41.741 --> 00:01:42.909
(echoes):
Echo!

00:01:42.992 --> 00:01:44.077
(chuckles)

00:01:45.119 --> 00:01:46.120
(voice echoing,
laughter in distance)

00:01:46.204 --> 00:01:47.580
Huh?

00:01:48.373 --> 00:01:51.084
Too bad your molehog friend
isn't here, huh?

00:01:51.167 --> 00:01:52.794
You're not really friends
with him, are you?

00:01:53.127 --> 00:01:54.712
Yeah, come clean, Peaches.

00:01:54.796 --> 00:01:56.923
Are you friends with that
awkward little rodent or not?

00:01:57.340 --> 00:02:00.760
I mean, Louis and I--
we've hung out or whatever,

00:02:01.552 --> 00:02:04.430
but no, we're not
really friends-friends.

00:02:04.806 --> 00:02:05.640
Not friends?

00:02:05.723 --> 00:02:06.641
(gasps)

00:02:07.433 --> 00:02:08.268
Louis!

00:02:08.351 --> 00:02:09.185
Uh, I...

00:02:09.269 --> 00:02:10.436
(gasps) Busted.

00:02:10.895 --> 00:02:11.896
(chuckles)

00:02:11.980 --> 00:02:13.731
I mean, uh...

00:02:13.815 --> 00:02:14.774
(sighs)

00:02:15.108 --> 00:02:16.401
Good to know.

00:02:17.026 --> 00:02:18.361
Louis, wait!

00:02:19.195 --> 00:02:20.738
-(thud): Ow.
-(Steffie laughs)

00:02:20.822 --> 00:02:22.699
He even runs away
like a loser.

00:02:22.782 --> 00:02:25.159
Whoa, Peaches, don't stress.

00:02:25.243 --> 00:02:26.369
You're with us now.

00:02:26.452 --> 00:02:28.997
Yeah, stress is
so... stressful.

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:31.416
STEFFIE: Yeah, girl, if you're
gonna stress about something,

00:02:31.499 --> 00:02:32.709
stress about your hair.

00:02:32.792 --> 00:02:33.710
KATIE: Ooh, I know, right?

00:02:33.793 --> 00:02:35.586
-This humidity? Ugh.
-(rumbling)

00:02:35.670 --> 00:02:36.754
STEFFIE: I can't stand it.

00:02:38.172 --> 00:02:39.632
(wind whistling)

00:02:39.716 --> 00:02:41.926
Uh, guys, we should
get out of here.

00:02:42.010 --> 00:02:43.052
Are you kidding?!

00:02:43.136 --> 00:02:44.387
This is epic!

00:02:44.470 --> 00:02:45.847
(wind roaring)

00:02:45.930 --> 00:02:47.181
Go, go, go!

00:02:49.684 --> 00:02:50.643
(panting)

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:53.104
(grunts)

00:02:53.646 --> 00:02:55.189
-(laughter)
-Yeah.

00:02:55.523 --> 00:02:57.025
How sick was that?!

00:02:57.108 --> 00:02:58.943
Yo, that was insane.

00:02:59.027 --> 00:03:00.153
(laughs)

00:03:00.236 --> 00:03:01.779
Hey, Peach, loosen up.

00:03:01.863 --> 00:03:02.864
Have some fun.

00:03:02.947 --> 00:03:03.781
Fun?

00:03:03.865 --> 00:03:05.199
You call that fun?

00:03:05.658 --> 00:03:07.035
-I'm out of here.
-Come on.

00:03:07.118 --> 00:03:09.120
I mean, do you really want
to go back to hanging with

00:03:09.203 --> 00:03:12.665
a weird molehog freak
and give all of this up?

00:03:12.749 --> 00:03:14.208
I mean, it's bad enough
that your family

00:03:14.292 --> 00:03:15.126
is half possum and...

00:03:15.209 --> 00:03:16.294
Bad enough?

00:03:16.377 --> 00:03:19.714
There is nothing bad about
being part of my family.

00:03:19.797 --> 00:03:21.215
I like hanging by my tail.

00:03:21.299 --> 00:03:22.759
And if you geniuses
are normal,

00:03:22.842 --> 00:03:25.094
the species is gonna
end up extinct!

00:03:25.762 --> 00:03:28.848
Uh, yeah, well, your species
is gonna be extinct first.

00:03:28.931 --> 00:03:30.183
(laughs)
Burn!

00:03:30.266 --> 00:03:33.019
(sighs) We're the
same species, genius.

00:03:33.102 --> 00:03:35.271
What?!
Double burn!

00:03:47.075 --> 00:03:49.911
(Sid groaning weakly)

00:03:52.955 --> 00:03:54.916
(continues groaning)

00:03:55.333 --> 00:03:57.668
Oh, hey, I can
wiggle my toe again!

00:03:57.752 --> 00:03:58.586
The important one.

00:03:58.669 --> 00:04:00.797
The little piggy
who went to market.

00:04:01.214 --> 00:04:03.174
Wait, I'm-I'm talking again.

00:04:03.257 --> 00:04:05.760
Oh, I have so many things
trapped inside of me

00:04:05.843 --> 00:04:07.428
that I couldn't say.

00:04:07.512 --> 00:04:10.181
Like... hey, I'm not dead!

00:04:10.264 --> 00:04:12.433
And why does a hurricane
have an eye but not an ear?

00:04:12.517 --> 00:04:14.018
-(groans)
-I'll push him overboard.

00:04:14.102 --> 00:04:15.686
You guys say
it was an accident.

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:16.687
And-and why do males
have nipples?

00:04:16.771 --> 00:04:18.439
I'm in. How about you, Diego?

00:04:18.523 --> 00:04:19.357
Diego?

00:04:19.732 --> 00:04:21.609
Hey, relax, buddy.

00:04:21.943 --> 00:04:24.695
Captain Crazy and his floating
petting zoo are history.

00:04:25.071 --> 00:04:27.615
Come on, we're
finally heading home!

00:04:27.698 --> 00:04:29.200
I don't know
what's wrong with me.

00:04:29.283 --> 00:04:30.576
I can't eat, can't sleep.

00:04:30.910 --> 00:04:32.120
Maybe I'm coming down
with something.

00:04:32.203 --> 00:04:33.371
(chuckles)

00:04:33.454 --> 00:04:35.289
Oh, I know
what you've got.

00:04:36.082 --> 00:04:37.375
The "L" word.

00:04:37.458 --> 00:04:39.252
Yeah, leprosy.

00:04:39.335 --> 00:04:42.088
No, Sid, no,
it's four letters.

00:04:42.171 --> 00:04:44.424
Starts with "L,"
ends with "E."

00:04:44.966 --> 00:04:46.426
Aha! Lice!

00:04:46.509 --> 00:04:50.096
No, Diego,
my friend, is in love.

00:04:50.179 --> 00:04:52.723
Oh, yeah. Love.

00:04:53.099 --> 00:04:55.226
You mean with the pirate? No.

00:04:55.309 --> 00:04:57.520
Oh, Shira's gotten
under your skin.

00:04:57.603 --> 00:04:58.646
Come on. Admit it.

00:04:58.729 --> 00:05:00.857
A rugged saber like you.

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:02.942
A more rugged saber like her.

00:05:03.025 --> 00:05:03.860
(laughs)

00:05:03.943 --> 00:05:05.194
No, no, no.

00:05:05.278 --> 00:05:06.446
You guys are dead wrong.

00:05:07.113 --> 00:05:08.739
(both laugh)

00:05:08.823 --> 00:05:10.199
Denial is the clincher!

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:12.160
You're in love, pussycat.

00:05:12.243 --> 00:05:14.787
♪ Diego and Shira
sitting in a tree ♪

00:05:14.871 --> 00:05:17.373
♪ K-I-S-S-I-N-G ♪

00:05:17.457 --> 00:05:19.834
Real mature, guys.
Real mature.

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:21.878
(Sid singing): ♪ Then comes
the baby in the baby carriage ♪

00:05:23.504 --> 00:05:24.547
(sighs)

00:05:26.757 --> 00:05:27.800
SHIRA (distantly): Diego...

00:05:32.722 --> 00:05:36.017
Diego...

00:05:36.517 --> 00:05:37.435
Shira?

00:05:38.227 --> 00:05:40.104
I wanted to come with you.

00:05:41.105 --> 00:05:41.939
(chuckles)

00:05:42.023 --> 00:05:43.274
(purrs)

00:05:43.357 --> 00:05:45.234
She's beautiful.

00:05:45.318 --> 00:05:46.944
Sid...

00:05:47.028 --> 00:05:51.324
I adore a sloth who cares
nothing about personal hygiene.

00:05:51.407 --> 00:05:52.825
That's me, baby.

00:05:52.909 --> 00:05:53.951
Ooh.

00:05:54.035 --> 00:05:57.663
Granny, come to me, Granny.

00:05:57.997 --> 00:05:59.707
(grunts)

00:06:00.291 --> 00:06:02.043
Well, hello.

00:06:02.543 --> 00:06:06.214
The wrinklier the raisin,
the sweeter the fruit.

00:06:06.797 --> 00:06:08.466
Ooh. Granny likey.

00:06:08.549 --> 00:06:10.635
Granny likey very much.

00:06:10.718 --> 00:06:12.011
-Ooh!
-Huh?

00:06:12.094 --> 00:06:12.970
(giggles)

00:06:13.054 --> 00:06:14.847
Guys, guys, aren't you
paying a-attention...

00:06:14.931 --> 00:06:16.849
ELLIE (echoing):
Manny...

00:06:16.933 --> 00:06:19.310
-Manny, are you there?
-Ellie?

00:06:19.393 --> 00:06:21.062
We're over here, Manny.

00:06:21.145 --> 00:06:22.563
This way, Daddy.

00:06:22.939 --> 00:06:24.899
I really need you.

00:06:25.358 --> 00:06:27.235
I know, honey.
Stay there!

00:06:29.737 --> 00:06:30.571
I'm coming!

00:06:30.655 --> 00:06:32.323
You were right, Manny.

00:06:32.406 --> 00:06:33.824
You're always right.

00:06:33.908 --> 00:06:35.368
No, no, look, I was...

00:06:35.785 --> 00:06:36.953
Wait a minute.

00:06:37.036 --> 00:06:38.496
Ellie would never say that.

00:06:38.579 --> 00:06:39.705
Manny?

00:06:39.789 --> 00:06:40.623
Manny...

00:06:40.706 --> 00:06:41.582
Huh? No.

00:06:41.666 --> 00:06:42.833
No, they're not real.

00:06:42.917 --> 00:06:43.876
They're-they're monsters!

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:45.002
They're sirens!

00:06:45.086 --> 00:06:46.087
Don't listen to them!

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:47.588
♪ Who can take the sunrise ♪

00:06:48.381 --> 00:06:49.507
-♪ Sprinkle it with dew ♪
-(hissing)

00:06:50.716 --> 00:06:51.759
(ship rumbling)

00:06:52.218 --> 00:06:53.261
No!

00:06:53.344 --> 00:06:55.638
They may look real,
but they're not!

00:06:55.721 --> 00:06:57.348
MANNY: They're gonna
destroy the ship!

00:06:57.431 --> 00:06:59.559
-(purrs)
-SHIRA: Come on, tiger.

00:06:59.642 --> 00:07:00.935
Swim with me.

00:07:01.018 --> 00:07:01.936
(purrs)

00:07:02.019 --> 00:07:04.397
SIREN: Sid...

00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:06.774
I have a snack for you.

00:07:06.857 --> 00:07:08.234
(retches)

00:07:09.110 --> 00:07:11.237
And she cooks, too.

00:07:11.320 --> 00:07:12.280
(smooching)

00:07:12.363 --> 00:07:13.406
Sid, no!

00:07:13.489 --> 00:07:14.657
(roaring)

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:15.575
(grunts)

00:07:15.658 --> 00:07:16.826
-Whoa!
-Whoa!

00:07:16.909 --> 00:07:17.743
Mm.

00:07:19.161 --> 00:07:21.038
(straining)

00:07:24.792 --> 00:07:26.794
(roaring)

00:07:28.212 --> 00:07:29.380
Mm.

00:07:29.463 --> 00:07:30.298
Why are we kissing?

00:07:30.381 --> 00:07:33.009
Um, 'cause cruises
are romantic?

00:07:33.634 --> 00:07:35.011
(roaring)

00:07:35.094 --> 00:07:36.137
Whew.

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:38.264
Five more seconds
and we'd have been goners.

00:07:39.390 --> 00:07:40.308
Call me.

00:07:40.391 --> 00:07:41.809
Ew.

00:07:41.892 --> 00:07:42.977
Uh-uh.

00:07:43.561 --> 00:07:44.687
Huh?

00:07:45.313 --> 00:07:46.772
(grunting quietly)

00:07:46.856 --> 00:07:48.691
(chuckles) Ew.

